<question-record>
<question>Un sasso viene lanciato verso l&apos;alto, raggiunge l&apos;altezza massima e torna gi&amp;#x00f9;. 

Quale, fra le affermazioni seguenti che riguardano l&apos;accelerazione del sasso, risulta vera?</question>
<clue></clue>
<category></category>
<weighting>100</weighting>
<fixed>0</fixed>
<question-type>1</question-type>
<answers>
<answer><text>Varia continuamente, con un valore massimo all&apos;inizio e zero alla sommit&amp;#x00e0;.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Cambia solo il segno quando il sasso &amp;#x00e8; alla sommit&amp;#x00e0;.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Rimane sempre costante.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Nel punto pi&amp;#x00f9; alto &amp;#x00e8; diretta orizzontalmente in avanti.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Varia ed &amp;#x00e8; zero all&apos;inizio e massima alla sommit&amp;#x00e0;.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer></answers>
</question-record>
